# SuperiorSkyblock2 messages in the RapidSkies style (PLAN.md §2). Its stock messages each open
# with their own tag ("&e&lIsland | ", "&c&lError | ", ...); here they all open with the network
# prefix instead, "RAPIDSKIES » " in & codes: &{HEX:FFD800}&lRAPID&f&lSKIES &8» (SuperiorSkyblock2
# writes hex as &{HEX:RRGGBB}). Errors drop the "Error" tag for a red body, like rapid-core's
# <prefix><error>. The help pages' "SuperiorSkyblock" title takes the prefix too.
#
# Bank amounts were a dollar sign before {0}, which rsdeploy would read as a secrets
# placeholder; SkyRealms' money is Coins, so they read "{0} Coins".
#
# Every message whose stock text changes is listed, taken from the en-US.yml bundled with
# SuperiorSkyblock2 2026.3; the bodies are otherwise unchanged. When an update adds messages,
# give the new ones the same prefix here. auto-language-detection is off in config.yml.patch,
# so every player gets this file.

